OL,3,GNEWSAChildren who died in fire 'brought
OL,4,Ajoy to everyone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree children who died in a house fire
OL,7,F"brought joy to everyone" and will be
OL,8,F"deeply missed", their head teachers
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FSixteen-year-old Leo Brabin and his
OL,12,Feight and seven-year-old brother and
OL,13,Fsister, Ellis and Prudence Brabin died
OL,14,Falong with their mother Elisha in a
OL,15,Fblaze which "spread rapidly" inside a
OL,16,Fhouse on Stone Square in Bootle,
OL,17,FMerseyside, in the early hours of
OL,18,FTuesday.
OL,20,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service and
OL,21,FMerseyside Police are continuing to
OL,22,Finvestigate the cause of the fire.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
