OL,3,GNEWSAChildren who died in fire 'brought
OL,4,Ajoy to everyone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teachers at Presfield School, St
OL,7,FElizabeth's RC Primary School and Acre
OL,8,FView School said the children would be
OL,9,Fremembered for their "kindness,
OL,10,Fdetermination and positive impact".
